  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall outcome of the project is to enhance youth and women employment and empowerment. To achieve this goal, this project will seek to (i) provide equal access to quality training and orientation for young male and female; (ii) ensure and promote equal access to coaching in entrepreneurship for young men and women; (iii) promote equal access to information on labor market opportunities for young men and women; (iv) accelerate youth and women empowerment through training and transmission o</narrative>
  </description>
